title: Outreach to the Left
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: left_outreach_timer <= 0
on-arrival: left_outreach_timer = 8

= Outreach to the Left

Our left flank is restless: some want to work within the party, others point toward third parties and street protest.

- @dsa_activists: Welcome left activists into the party
- @policy_concessions: Offer policy concessions
- @discipline_left: Draw a line against extremism
- @easy_discard

@dsa_activists
on-arrival: left_relation += 8; farleft_strength -= 1.5; progressive_strength += 3; progressive_dissent -= 5; moderate_dissent += 3; biz_relation -= 2; young_dem += 2*(1-dissent); month_actions += 1

Democratic socialists and movement groups find seats at the table.

@policy_concessions
subtitle: -1 resource, -1 budget
unavailable-subtitle: Need 1 resource.
choose-if: resources >= 1
on-arrival: left_relation += 5; farleft_strength -= 1; progressive_dissent -= 4; resources -= 1; budget -= 1; month_actions += 1

We adopt several demands in the platform.

@discipline_left
on-arrival: left_relation -= 6; farleft_strength += 1; radicalization -= 0; suburban_dem += 3*(1-dissent); progressive_dissent += 6; moderate_dissent -= 3; directleft_militancy -= 0.05; month_actions += 1

We condemn violence and fringe positions. Swing voters approve; activists fume.
